"{\"content\":\"# greet-pkg\\n\\nA minimal Node.js package that exports a simple greeting function.\\n\\n## Install\\n\\n```bash\\nnpm install greet-pkg\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```js\\nconst { greet } = require(\\\"./index\\\");\\n\\ngreet();        // \\\"Hello, world!\\\"\\ngreet(\\\"Ada\\\");   // \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"\\n```\\n\\n## API\\n\\n### `greet(name?)`\\n\\nReturns the string `Hello, <name>!`. Defaults to `\\\"world\\\"` when `name` is omitted.\\n\\n## License\\n\\nMIT\\n\",\"path\":\"README.md\"}"